Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.48,0:00:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Hermes, how fast is\Nthis thing going right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.66,0:00:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,170? 200?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.20,0:00:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We're getting off of this thing! Emporio!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.64,0:00:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But when those rods came into my life\Nand I saw them for the first time,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.34,0:00:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally realized its importance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.50,0:00:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't about the dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.20,0:00:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The moon landing was an\Nachievement for all humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.94,0:00:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That day, we humans conquered\Nthe moon and our spirits evolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's truly significant is the\Nevolution of the human race!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.08,0:00:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't gotta worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.26,0:00:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I honestly don't even feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.98,0:00:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Compared to all the shit I've\Ngone through to get to the priest,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.78,0:00:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,this pain is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.56,0:01:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You crazy bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.24,0:01:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're trying to test my spirit,\Nit's way stronger than yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.10,0:01:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna finish you here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.56,0:01:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.36,0:01:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene! Aw, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.52,0:01:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A girl's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.04,0:01:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be special since the priest\Ntook away the disc with his memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And he decided to keep him\Nalive in that prison...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.96,0:01:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather forecast.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.18,0:01:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Because he happens to be the\Npriest's biological brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.92,0:01:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go! To Orlando!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.32,0:01:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where we'll find him hiding, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.36,0:01:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Destiny is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.06,0:02:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.10,0:02:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.90,0:02:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.18,0:02:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,much
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.58,0:02:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,for joining us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.12,0:03:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.86,0:03:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.98,0:03:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.76,0:03:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not that the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.14,0:03:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not that the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.14,0:03:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.60,0:03:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.51,0:03:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Get surgery room 3 prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.08,0:03:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got an eight-year-old\Nboy in critical condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.66,0:03:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. It'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.40,0:03:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.66,0:03:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You said this is where\Nthe priest was hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.78,0:03:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is a fucking hospital?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.52,0:03:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.58,0:04:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know why, but he's\Ndefinitely waiting for us inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.46,0:04:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to put an end to this here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.26,0:04:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Emporio.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.17,0:04:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I need a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.28,0:04:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.60,0:04:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to take my father's\Ndisc and deliver it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.90,0:04:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If you call this number, the\NSpeedwagon Foundation will come get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.24,0:04:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to go in with you! I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.70,0:04:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But before that, I need you to\Nmake sure the disc gets delivered.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.90,0:04:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.18,0:04:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,By now, the priest should sense\Nthat I'm getting closer to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.22,0:04:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be separated\Nfrom you right now either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.72,0:04:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.36,0:04:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep in touch with this cell\Nphone I took off Rikiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.38,0:05:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to bother you,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.80,0:05:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'd like to hear your opinion\Non something I'm unsure of,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.44,0:05:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,particularly this dish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.32,0:05:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a bite if you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.88,0:05:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to taste test it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.96,0:05:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Versus...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.28,0:05:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,One bite is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.40,0:05:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,After you eat it, tell me\Nwhat ingredients are inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.52,0:05:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's shellfish, I can't eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.16,0:05:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm allergic, so I would get quite sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.08,0:05:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This is whitefish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.38,0:05:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Most likely, flounder.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.36,0:06:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It has been paired with this flan, a\Ndelectable pudding mixed with asparagus,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.00,0:06:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,and mashed up crab meat inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.58,0:06:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I detect no shellfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.76,0:06:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.88,0:06:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.84,0:06:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,May I have another small bite, but this\Ntime with a little dab of sauce on the side?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.38,0:06:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a faint scent from the sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.14,0:06:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Judging by the fishy aroma, I suspect\Nit's scallop paste mixed with cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.84,0:06:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How unfortunate?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.12,0:06:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I thought, there are\Nscallops inside the sauce!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.48,0:06:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Is your shoe size 27 centimeters?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.20,0:06:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon me, but could\Nyou stand for a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.40,0:06:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful not to open up\Nthe bullet wound on your leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.96,0:06:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Slowly now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.10,0:06:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're about 181 centimeters tall? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.24,0:06:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And you weigh precisely 72 kilograms?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.66,0:06:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Are your clothes size 52?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.04,0:07:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And do you tighten your watch\Nbelt on the second hole?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.50,0:07:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.60,0:07:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How interesting?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.64,0:07:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I'm unable to enjoy this fine meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.26,0:07:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm quite impressed by your ability to\Npick out the scallop from the sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.98,0:07:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It would appear we have\Na similar sense of taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.66,0:07:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.70,0:07:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Father Poochie,\Nwhat are you trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.60,0:07:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're aware I haven't\Nseen my own ability yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.06,0:07:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And plus, I can sense someone\Nquickly approaching our location.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.48,0:07:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to help in any way I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.54,0:07:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.44,0:07:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.68,0:07:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.18,0:07:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, their arrival might\Nactually prove useful to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.54,0:07:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.98,0:07:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your son's going to be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.66,0:08:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He's really close now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.88,0:08:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He's here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.60,0:08:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're still unable\Nto see your ability,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.06,0:08:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,then there's nothing\Nelse that can be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.56,0:08:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't struggle against things\Nbeyond your understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.28,0:08:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the power take its own course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.86,0:08:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If we are going to make it to heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.46,0:08:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You must ally yourself with the\Npower that lies dormant within you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.02,0:08:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And besides, there's a chance Jolene\Nmight overlook this room entirely.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.00,0:08:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Nevertheless,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.98,0:08:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I decided to order this dish because they\Ntold me there'd be no shellfish inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.38,0:08:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'd like, you may eat it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.66,0:08:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Father Pooji.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.22,0:08:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I, uh, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.36,0:08:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.27,0:08:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I was...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.94,0:08:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.90,0:08:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I was shot to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.62,0:08:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a lot of fun going\Nfor a ride in the ambulance,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.92,0:09:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,but it was ruined because\Nmy daddy doesn't like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.26,0:09:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,My daddy's the one who shot me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.98,0:09:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He was trying to kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.88,0:09:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey! Honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.04,0:09:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.64,0:09:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone was shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.80,0:09:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God! Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.62,0:09:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you have to take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.70,0:09:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.08,0:09:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.04,0:09:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This hospital room is a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.62,0:09:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That priest must have been in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.04,0:09:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, where the fuck is he hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.96,0:09:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever's going on, I\Nthink it's safe to assume.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.34,0:09:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That the new enemy that's been\Nhanging around the priest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.44,0:09:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,is the cause of all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.40,0:09:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, that gunshot didn't\Nexactly feel like a stand attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.26,0:09:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's more like somebody\Nfired a real bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.16,0:09:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And the poor bastard that got shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.24,0:09:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Who even is that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.84,0:10:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would he be the one to get hit?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.82,0:10:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, looking at him, he seems\Nto be just a random ordinary dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.94,0:10:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to hurry and\Nevacuate everyone on this floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.84,0:10:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now! Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.06,0:10:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that goes for you two as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.34,0:10:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and evacuate!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.62,0:10:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go call the police!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.64,0:10:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.55,0:10:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember that man now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.98,0:10:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the parent of that\Nkid who was brought in
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.84,0:10:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,by the ambulance when we\Nfirst got to this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.38,0:10:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it was a test shot. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.90,0:10:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what kind\Nof ability it could be,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.72,0:10:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,but if it's someone who just\Nhad their powers awakened,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.82,0:10:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,they would need to give it a test\Ndrive and try it out on somebody first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.72,0:10:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The priest is moving right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.96,0:10:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Somewhere down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.38,0:10:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard's inside the hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.10,0:10:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I can sense him getting\Nfurther away from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.74,0:11:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.08,0:11:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't just throw yourself\Ninto the hole like an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.92,0:11:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I'm against you on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.40,0:11:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Anybody could see it's an obvious trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.66,0:11:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't even go near the thing until we can\Nfind a clear connection between this deep,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.28,0:11:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,dark abyss and the man who\Ngot shot up in the hallway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.32,0:11:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever dug this hole started tunneling\Nto the side when they got deep enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.98,0:11:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see beyond that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.42,0:11:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The person that's accompanying Father\NPoochie right now goes by the name Versus.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.76,0:11:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,25, male.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.44,0:11:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.78,0:11:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I said it before and I'll say it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.50,0:11:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I ain't going down in this damn hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.30,0:11:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just wait for him to climb out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.00,0:11:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Or we gotta find a way to\Ndrag him out like rabbits.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.34,0:12:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm already well aware that\Nthis hole is an obvious trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.18,0:12:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.46,0:12:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But what happens if the priest is\Nplanning to hole himself up down
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.42,0:12:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,there for three more days while\Nhe waits for the new moon to come?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.38,0:12:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.29,0:12:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Given how capable he is,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.00,0:12:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet Poochie and his accomplice plan to
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.74,0:12:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,escape all the way to\NCape Canaveral like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.46,0:12:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,In three days,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.58,0:12:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,that man's going to develop\Nsome new ability that
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.84,0:12:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,will help him attain his\Nabsurd idea of heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.54,0:12:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But for now, all he has is Pale Snake,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.12,0:12:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,which merely allows him to\Ncontrol the memories of others.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.40,0:12:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our chance. If we\Nstrike him now, we can win.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.78,0:12:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't avoid it anymore if\Nwe want to end this for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.24,0:12:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We might have to kill the priest
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.26,0:12:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on to this, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.72,0:12:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let go. No matter what
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.46,0:12:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Joanne, what do\Nyou think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.72,0:12:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming with you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.78,0:12:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If we both go who's gonna stay\Nhere to help pull me back up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.26,0:12:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Take my rope and wrap it around your body.\NIf I need help, I'll signal. You got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.90,0:13:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull me out of here, whatever it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.78,0:13:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,She is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.34,0:13:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But still though, Jolene,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.08,0:13:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,if you keep pulling this\Nthread out of your body,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.62,0:13:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,just how far can you go\Nbefore you run out of slack?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.06,0:13:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.96,0:13:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.82,0:13:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you answering me? Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.64,0:13:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Where...am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.22,0:13:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Where...am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.98,0:13:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,2005?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.86,0:14:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.68,0:14:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.02,0:14:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,She came all this way\Ndragging her rope behind her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.52,0:14:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go cut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.56,0:14:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuck, not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.14,0:14:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.92,0:14:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes, hey! Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.00,0:14:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Things are bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.40,0:14:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Start pulling me up! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.70,0:14:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Hermes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.78,0:14:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.94,0:14:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, get me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.40,0:14:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gonna cut the rope!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.08,0:14:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Hermes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.34,0:14:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.26,0:14:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.18,0:14:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.09,0:14:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull me out of the fucking hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.04,0:14:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.94,0:14:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can hear me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.46,0:14:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Goddammit, what the ever-living\Nfuck is going on down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.02,0:15:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,and she couldn't have really\Ngone that far into the hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.22,0:15:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Hermes! Keep pulling!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.40,0:15:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna have to pull me up even more!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.98,0:15:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I welcome you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.60,0:15:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though you've come uninvited\Nand haven't greeted me, you may stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.00,0:15:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You chose to come into my hole\Nof your own volition. However,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.38,0:15:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I must insist the entirety of this tightly\Npulled rope comes in with you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.72,0:15:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.30,0:15:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Versus, will you be alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.16,0:15:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Compared to you who has recently\Ndeveloped a new stand ability,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.86,0:16:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene Kujo has undergone intense training\Nthrough her experiences in prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.92,0:16:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,She is much more accustomed\Nto all-out battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.06,0:16:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not surprising that she would steal a
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.28,0:16:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,pen from one of the\Npassengers on the plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.50,0:16:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not pursue Jolene any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.16,0:16:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You have done enough already, versus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.84,0:16:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,If Jolene wants to escape\Nfrom this hole, then so be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.50,0:16:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,She won't attempt to\Ncome back inside again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.08,0:16:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,At least not for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.98,0:16:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, all we can do is wait patiently.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.42,0:16:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll need to stay here\Nfor three more days.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.40,0:16:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me up there, Hermes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.20,0:16:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see a light now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.66,0:16:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I must be getting close to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.46,0:16:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull me up even harder,\Nokay? Yeah! Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.72,0:16:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hear you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.30,0:16:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm starting to be able to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.56,0:16:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.64,0:16:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is down in this deep hole?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.58,0:16:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy is staring\Nright at me as we speak!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.04,0:16:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, I could see the priest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.08,0:16:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.44,0:16:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to come up with another\Nway for us to get down here again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.46,0:16:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It would have been over\Nif they'd cut this rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.54,0:17:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me something I want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.50,0:17:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on now, Hermes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.18,0:17:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.32,0:17:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just a little curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.66,0:17:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I really want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.96,0:17:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How did it feel to get revenge on the\Nson of a bitch who murdered your sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.58,0:17:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you get some sort of\Nsick satisfaction out of
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.06,0:17:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,burring me alive in that sewer\Npipe you called an improv,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.74,0:17:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Goffin?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.96,0:17:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Sports Maximum!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.56,0:17:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.47,0:17:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on, Hermes?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.46,0:17:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.00,0:17:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.84,0:17:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The ground has a long memory of\Neverything that happens upon it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.48,0:17:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sort of like a tape recorder, or\Neven much like a digital camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.96,0:17:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,For example,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.12,0:17:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,it remembers that boy who was shot dead by
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.40,0:17:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,his own father when he\Nfell onto the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.80,0:17:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, where the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.52,0:17:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It even remembers the\Ngangster who was buried
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.80,0:18:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,alive in a sewer pipe\Nand drowned to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.50,0:18:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The Earth's memory is so powerful that it\Ncan even recall every single one of the
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.18,0:18:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,passengers who met their demise on a plane\Nthat fell to the ground in July of 2005,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.16,0:18:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,six years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.66,0:18:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.74,0:18:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.58,0:18:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Hermes! Stop! Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.66,0:18:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here thanks to versus stand ability\Nsee netherworld uncovers all the
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.44,0:18:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,folks who met the ground when they\Nperished and excavates their memories
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.96,0:18:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.52,0:18:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.74,0:18:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, ladies. Welcome\Naboard. Unfortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.26,0:18:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,this plane is expected\Nto lose control and crash
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.50,0:18:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,into the ground at approximately\N2133 on July Saudi, 2005.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.50,0:18:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We ask that you please turn\Noff all electronic devices,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.48,0:18:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,and make sure that your seatbelt is\Nsecurely fastened around your lower waist.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.92,0:19:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I suggest you heed that warning,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.84,0:19:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,or you'll end up like the man who\Nwas sitting in the seat behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.96,0:19:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,His head was lodged straight\Ninto my stomach on impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.50,0:19:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Ain't no way! Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.06,0:19:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the entrance?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.34,0:19:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Start looking, Hermes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.64,0:19:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.76,0:19:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what even is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.86,0:19:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a hallucination, Jolene?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.00,0:19:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It should be on the ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.30,0:19:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Look for the place we came in from.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.80,0:19:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything in this fucking\Nplane feels so real, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.28,0:19:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to find the way out of here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.22,0:19:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Before you fell down, was there anyone\Ncoming to check the room above the hall?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.38,0:19:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a panic in the halls\Nafter that boy's dad was shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.46,0:19:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The police had to have shown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.38,0:19:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.76,0:19:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I have no clue. Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.12,0:19:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,even if the cops came, they\Nwouldn't be able to hear us calling,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.52,0:19:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,just like I couldn't hear\Nyou up there earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.02,0:19:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How's this plane down here anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.66,0:19:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't see anything like this when I\Nwas waiting for you to come out the hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.94,0:19:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, miss, please refrain\Nfrom punching the ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.90,0:20:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If you would, kindly take\Nyour seat and wait quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.66,0:20:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This plane will be crashing\Nin less than three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.22,0:20:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, then let us see the pilot!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.38,0:20:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta make him land\Nthis plane immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.66,0:20:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Now hurry up, lady, and\Ntake us to the cockpit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.86,0:20:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,No point.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.74,0:20:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We weren't able to land the plane safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.12,0:20:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the reason why we crashed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.24,0:20:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately for us, we all burned\Nto death when the plane crash landed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.08,0:20:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It exploded and That was when my body
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.76,0:20:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,um excuse me sir did you not hear me
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.58,0:20:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,when I told everyone to turn off of all\Nof their electronic devices earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.84,0:20:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.16,0:20:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I remember this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.96,0:20:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It was flight number 2882 to Dallas.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.66,0:20:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Around six or seven years ago, it\Ncrashed somewhere near Orlando.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.06,0:20:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We're dealing with ghosts here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.80,0:20:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we're memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.48,0:20:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.56,0:21:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Remnants of memories that\Nwere recorded by the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.60,0:21:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to tell me we're\Nactually gonna crash in this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.78,0:21:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you not make this plane\Ncrash happen any faster?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.56,0:21:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been sensing weather forecasts\Ngetting closer to our position.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.64,0:21:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears that he is drawing\Never closer toward this hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.36,0:21:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear to God, if you don't shut the fuck\Nup already and stop confusing me, Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.14,0:21:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you speaking to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.74,0:21:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Netherworld's ability is to\Nexcavate memories from the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.56,0:21:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And this plane is set to crash\Nspecifically at 2133 on the dot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.76,0:21:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Also,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.67,0:21:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,try not to forget that\NI've capitalized on this
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.34,0:21:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,opportunity and managed to pull\NErmes into my hole as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.16,0:22:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I have done this all for you, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.12,0:22:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now just leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.72,0:22:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I cope.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.58,0:22:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My head is filled with hope
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.56,0:22:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Of some place
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.14,0:22:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,other than here
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.54,0:22:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I smile
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.78,0:22:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside and all the while
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.06,0:23:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering about my destiny?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.94,0:23:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.02,0:23:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,about all the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.68,0:23:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,things I'd like
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.54,0:23:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,to do in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.00,0:23:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a dreamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.38,0:23:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A distant dreamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.38,0:23:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.76,0:23:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,From today!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.54,0:23:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.54,0:24:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
